<div class="sc-hero-band" data-hana-bg="flow" data-variant="light" data-fade="none" style="background:#fff;position:relative;z-index:1;overflow:hidden;"><img src="~/images/circuit-board-blue.png" aria-hidden="true" style="position:absolute;top:15px;right:-80px;width:300px;height:300px;opacity:0.4;pointer-events:none;z-index:0;user-select:none;transform:rotate(8deg);" /><div class="cap-section cap-section--band cap-section--hero"><div style="margin-bottom:64px;">
    <div style="font-family:var(--font-text);font-size:10px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:0.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--hana-blue);margin-bottom:14px;">PCBA & Box Build · Sub-capability</div>
    <h1 style="font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:46px;font-weight:700;color:var(--ink);line-height:1.06;letter-spacing:-0.03em;margin:0 0 18px;max-width:740px;text-wrap:balance;">Surface mount technology (SMT) assembly</h1>
    <p style="font-family:var(--font-text);font-size:18px;color:var(--ink-2);line-height:1.55;max-width:660px;margin:0 0 32px;text-wrap:pretty;">Fine-pitch, double-sided SMT for products ranging from 01005 passives to 0.2 mm pitch micro-BGA and WLCSP. Solder-paste inspection, 3D AOI and X-ray are integrated into the standard process, with qualified SMT capability across Hana sites in China, Thailand, Cambodia and the USA.</p>
    <div style="position:relative;overflow:hidden;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid var(--line);background:var(--surface);width:100%;height:407px;"><img src="~/images/capabilities/cap-pcba-box-build-smt-assembly-hero.webp" alt="SMT line with inline inspection" style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;"></div>
    <div class="hana-spec-block" style="margin-top:18px;"><div class="hana-spec-item"><div class="hana-spec-label" style="display:block;margin-bottom:8px;">Capability locations</div><div class="hana-spec-value" style="font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:22px;">4</div></div><div class="hana-spec-item"><div class="hana-spec-label" style="display:block;margin-bottom:8px;">Smallest passive</div><div class="hana-spec-value" style="font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:22px;">01005</div></div><div class="hana-spec-item"><div class="hana-spec-label" style="display:block;margin-bottom:8px;">Min micro-BGA pitch</div><div class="hana-spec-value" style="font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:17px;">0.2 mm</div></div><div class="hana-spec-item"><div class="hana-spec-label" style="display:block;margin-bottom:8px;">Placement accuracy</div><div class="hana-spec-value" style="font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:17px;">±50 µm</div></div></div>
  </div></div></div>

<div class="sc-pillars-band" data-hana-bg="wafer" data-variant="light" data-accent="" data-fade="none" style="background:linear-gradient(120deg,#f5f7fa 35%,#d8e6f3 100%);position:relative;overflow:hidden;"><div class="cap-section cap-section--band"><div style="margin-bottom:64px;"><div style="margin-bottom:26px;"><h2 style="font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:28px;font-weight:600;color:var(--ink);line-height:1.2;letter-spacing:-0.02em;margin:0;">Capability overview</h2><p style="font-family:var(--font-text);font-size:15.5px;color:var(--ink-2);line-height:1.6;max-width:640px;margin:10px 0 0;">Hana's SMT capability covers the complete assembly flow, a broad component range and in-line inspection throughout production.</p></div>
    <div class="cap-grid-3">
      <div class="sc-pillar" style="border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--radius-card);overflow:hidden;background:#fff;display:flex;flex-direction:column;">
      <div style="padding:22px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;flex:1;">
        <div style="width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:8px;background:var(--hana-blue);color:#fff;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-bottom:14px;"><i data-lucide="flame" style="width:18px;height:18px;"></i></div>
        <div style="font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:20px;font-weight:600;color:var(--ink);letter-spacing:-0.01em;margin-bottom:10px;">SMT process</div>
        <p style="font-family:var(--font-text);font-size:13.5px;color:var(--ink-2);line-height:1.55;margin:0 0 16px;">A complete SMT process from solder-paste printing through placement, reflow, inspection and de-paneling, with additional soldering options where the product requires them.</p>
        <ul style="list-style:none;padding:0;margin:0 0 16px;"><li style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:16px 1fr;gap:8px;align-items:baseline;padding:6px 0;"><span style="color:var(--hana-blue);font-weight:700;">&rsaquo;</span><span style="font-family:var(--font-text);font-size:13px;color:var(--ink-2);line-height:1.5;">Print → SPI → place → reflow → AOI → X-ray → ICT → de-panel</span></li><li style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:16px 1fr;gap:8px;align-items:baseline;padding:6px 0;"><span style="color:var(--hana-blue);font-weight:700;">&rsaquo;</span><span style="font-family:var(--font-text);font-size:13px;color:var(--ink-2);line-height:1.5;">Convection reflow in air or nitrogen</span></li><li style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:16px 1fr;gap:8px;align-items:baseline;padding:6px 0;"><span style="color:var(--hana-blue);font-weight:700;">&rsaquo;</span><span style="font-family:var(--font-text);font-size:13px;color:var(--ink-2);line-height:1.5;">Vacuum N₂ reflow for reduced voiding</span></li><li style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:16px 1fr;gap:8px;align-items:baseline;padding:6px 0;"><span style="color:var(--hana-blue);font-weight:700;">&rsaquo;</span><span style="font-family:var(--font-text);font-size:13px;color:var(--ink-2);line-height:1.5;">Selective wave and robotic soldering for through-hole components</span></li><li style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:16px 1fr;gap:8px;align-items:baseline;padding:6px 0;"><span style="color:var(--hana-blue);font-weight:700;">&rsaquo;</span><span style="font-family:var(--font-text);font-size:13px;color:var(--ink-2);line-height:1.5;">Routing, laser cutting, V-cut and punching for de-paneling</span></li></ul>
      </div>
    </div>
      <div class="sc-pillar" style="border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--radius-card);overflow:hidden;background:#fff;display:flex;flex-direction:column;">
      <div style="padding:22px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;flex:1;">
        <div style="width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:8px;background:var(--hana-blue);color:#fff;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-bottom:14px;"><i data-lucide="ruler" style="width:18px;height:18px;"></i></div>
        <div style="font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:20px;font-weight:600;color:var(--ink);letter-spacing:-0.01em;margin-bottom:10px;">Fine-pitch capability</div>
        <p style="font-family:var(--font-text);font-size:13.5px;color:var(--ink-2);line-height:1.55;margin:0 0 16px;">Fine-pitch assembly is supported within the standard SMT process, covering ultra-small passives, array packages and large-format QFP.</p>
        <ul style="list-style:none;padding:0;margin:0 0 16px;"><li style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:16px 1fr;gap:8px;align-items:baseline;padding:6px 0;"><span style="color:var(--hana-blue);font-weight:700;">&rsaquo;</span><span style="font-family:var(--font-text);font-size:13px;color:var(--ink-2);line-height:1.5;">01005 passives and larger</span></li><li style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:16px 1fr;gap:8px;align-items:baseline;padding:6px 0;"><span style="color:var(--hana-blue);font-weight:700;">&rsaquo;</span><span style="font-family:var(--font-text);font-size:13px;color:var(--ink-2);line-height:1.5;">Micro-BGA and WLCSP to 0.2 mm pitch</span></li><li style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:16px 1fr;gap:8px;align-items:baseline;padding:6px 0;"><span style="color:var(--hana-blue);font-weight:700;">&rsaquo;</span><span style="font-family:var(--font-text);font-size:13px;color:var(--ink-2);line-height:1.5;">BGA ball build and rework for 0.2–0.76 mm balls</span></li><li style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:16px 1fr;gap:8px;align-items:baseline;padding:6px 0;"><span style="color:var(--hana-blue);font-weight:700;">&rsaquo;</span><span style="font-family:var(--font-text);font-size:13px;color:var(--ink-2);line-height:1.5;">QFP to 54 × 54 mm at 0.4 mm pitch</span></li></ul>
      </div>
    </div>
      <div class="sc-pillar" style="border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--radius-card);overflow:hidden;background:#fff;display:flex;flex-direction:column;">
      <div style="padding:22px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;flex:1;">
        <div style="width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:8px;background:var(--hana-blue);color:#fff;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-bottom:14px;"><i data-lucide="shield" style="width:18px;height:18px;"></i></div>
        <div style="font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:20px;font-weight:600;color:var(--ink);letter-spacing:-0.01em;margin-bottom:10px;">Inspection and traceability</div>
        <p style="font-family:var(--font-text);font-size:13.5px;color:var(--ink-2);line-height:1.55;margin:0 0 16px;">Inspection is integrated throughout the line, with traceability maintained from incoming material through finished product.</p>
        <ul style="list-style:none;padding:0;margin:0 0 16px;"><li style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:16px 1fr;gap:8px;align-items:baseline;padding:6px 0;"><span style="color:var(--hana-blue);font-weight:700;">&rsaquo;</span><span style="font-family:var(--font-text);font-size:13px;color:var(--ink-2);line-height:1.5;">Inline solder-paste inspection</span></li><li style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:16px 1fr;gap:8px;align-items:baseline;padding:6px 0;"><span style="color:var(--hana-blue);font-weight:700;">&rsaquo;</span><span style="font-family:var(--font-text);font-size:13px;color:var(--ink-2);line-height:1.5;">Pre- and post-reflow 3D AOI</span></li><li style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:16px 1fr;gap:8px;align-items:baseline;padding:6px 0;"><span style="color:var(--hana-blue);font-weight:700;">&rsaquo;</span><span style="font-family:var(--font-text);font-size:13px;color:var(--ink-2);line-height:1.5;">2D and 3D X-ray for BGA, BTC and PoP</span></li><li style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:16px 1fr;gap:8px;align-items:baseline;padding:6px 0;"><span style="color:var(--hana-blue);font-weight:700;">&rsaquo;</span><span style="font-family:var(--font-text);font-size:13px;color:var(--ink-2);line-height:1.5;">Full material, unit and product traceability</span></li><li style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:16px 1fr;gap:8px;align-items:baseline;padding:6px 0;"><span style="color:var(--hana-blue);font-weight:700;">&rsaquo;</span><span style="font-family:var(--font-text);font-size:13px;color:var(--ink-2);line-height:1.5;">Dedicated medical and automotive lines</span></li><li style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:16px 1fr;gap:8px;align-items:baseline;padding:6px 0;"><span style="color:var(--hana-blue);font-weight:700;">&rsaquo;</span><span style="font-family:var(--font-text);font-size:13px;color:var(--ink-2);line-height:1.5;">Full ESD control</span></li></ul>
      </div>
    </div>
    </div>
  </div></div></div>

<div style="background:#fff;"><div class="cap-section"><div style="margin-bottom:44px;"><div style="margin-bottom:26px;"><h2 style="font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:28px;font-weight:600;color:var(--ink);line-height:1.2;letter-spacing:-0.02em;margin:0;">Why run SMT with Hana</h2></div><div class="why-grid"><div class="why-cell why-order-1"><div style="position:relative;overflow:hidden;border-radius:var(--radius-panel);padding:32px 30px;background:linear-gradient(152deg,#155F9B 0%,#0E4A7C 46%,#0A3860 100%);border:none;"><div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;margin-bottom:22px;"><img src="~/images/hana-mark-white.svg" alt="" style="width:36px;height:36px;display:block;flex:none;"><span style="flex:1;height:1px;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.24);"></span></div><div style="font-family:var(--font-text);font-size:10px;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.1em;color:#7EC8FF;margin-bottom:10px;">One process, every site</div><h3 style="font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:23px;font-weight:600;color:#fff;line-height:1.22;letter-spacing:-0.02em;margin:0 0 12px;text-wrap:balance;">Qualified SMT capability across multiple countries</h3><p style="font-family:var(--font-text);font-size:14.5px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.84);line-height:1.6;margin:0 0 16px;">SMT is qualified across China, Thailand, Cambodia and the USA, giving customers greater flexibility to manage capacity, regional production requirements and supply-chain resilience. Programs can transfer between Hana sites through documented first-article qualification rather than a complete re-NPI.</p><ul style="list-style:none;padding:0;margin:0;"><li style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:16px 1fr;gap:10px;align-items:baseline;padding:9px 0;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.2);"><span style="color:#7EC8FF;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;line-height:1;">&rsaquo;</span><span style="font-family:var(--font-text);font-size:13.5px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.88);line-height:1.55;">Qualified SMT capability across four countries</span></li><li style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:16px 1fr;gap:10px;align-items:baseline;padding:9px 0;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.2);"><span style="color:#7EC8FF;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;line-height:1;">&rsaquo;</span><span style="font-family:var(--font-text);font-size:13.5px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.88);line-height:1.55;">Site transfer through documented first-article qualification</span></li><li style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:16px 1fr;gap:10px;align-items:baseline;padding:9px 0;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.2);"><span style="color:#7EC8FF;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;line-height:1;">&rsaquo;</span><span style="font-family:var(--font-text);font-size:13.5px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.88);line-height:1.55;">Greater flexibility across regions and manufacturing capacity</span></li><li style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:16px 1fr;gap:10px;align-items:baseline;padding:9px 0;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.2);border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.2);"><span style="color:#7EC8FF;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;line-height:1;">&rsaquo;</span><span style="font-family:var(--font-text);font-size:13.5px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.88);line-height:1.55;">Common process capability from NPI through volume production</span></li></ul></div></div><div class="why-cell why-photo-cell why-order-2"><div style="position:relative;overflow:hidden;border-radius:var(--radius-panel);border:1px solid var(--line);background:var(--surface);width:100%;height:100%;min-height:320px;"><img src="~/images/capabilities/cap-pcba-box-build-smt-assembly-why-1.webp" alt="Standardized SMT line at a second site" style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;"></div></div></div>
<div class="why-grid"><div class="why-cell why-order-2"><div style="position:relative;overflow:hidden;border-radius:var(--radius-panel);padding:32px 30px;background:linear-gradient(152deg,#FFFFFF 0%,#E5EEF5 58%,#D8E6F1 100%);border:1px solid #CBDCEA;"><div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;margin-bottom:22px;"><img src="~/images/hana-mark.svg" alt="" style="width:36px;height:36px;display:block;flex:none;"><span style="flex:1;height:1px;background:#BFD4E4;"></span></div><div style="font-family:var(--font-text);font-size:10px;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.1em;color:var(--hana-blue);margin-bottom:10px;">EMS + OSAT, vertically integrated</div><h3 style="font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:23px;font-weight:600;color:var(--ink);line-height:1.22;letter-spacing:-0.02em;margin:0 0 12px;text-wrap:balance;">SMT within a broader EMS and OSAT capability</h3><p style="font-family:var(--font-text);font-size:14.5px;color:var(--ink-2);line-height:1.6;margin:0 0 16px;">Hana combines SMT with wafer processing, die attach, wire bond, chip-on-board, flip chip and full box-build assembly within the same group. This allows engineering teams to bring more of the manufacturing flow together where it makes sense, supported by DFM review before production introduction.</p><ul style="list-style:none;padding:0;margin:0;"><li style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:16px 1fr;gap:10px;align-items:baseline;padding:9px 0;border-top:1px solid #CBDCEA;"><span style="color:var(--hana-blue);font-size:14px;font-weight:700;line-height:1;">&rsaquo;</span><span style="font-family:var(--font-text);font-size:13.5px;color:var(--ink-2);line-height:1.55;">EMS and OSAT within one group</span></li><li style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:16px 1fr;gap:10px;align-items:baseline;padding:9px 0;border-top:1px solid #CBDCEA;"><span style="color:var(--hana-blue);font-size:14px;font-weight:700;line-height:1;">&rsaquo;</span><span style="font-family:var(--font-text);font-size:13.5px;color:var(--ink-2);line-height:1.55;">DFM and early-stage engineering collaboration</span></li><li style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:16px 1fr;gap:10px;align-items:baseline;padding:9px 0;border-top:1px solid #CBDCEA;"><span style="color:var(--hana-blue);font-size:14px;font-weight:700;line-height:1;">&rsaquo;</span><span style="font-family:var(--font-text);font-size:13.5px;color:var(--ink-2);line-height:1.55;">Integration from SMT through box build and drop-ship</span></li><li style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:16px 1fr;gap:10px;align-items:baseline;padding:9px 0;border-top:1px solid #CBDCEA;border-bottom:1px solid #CBDCEA;"><span style="color:var(--hana-blue);font-size:14px;font-weight:700;line-height:1;">&rsaquo;</span><span style="font-family:var(--font-text);font-size:13.5px;color:var(--ink-2);line-height:1.55;">Customer IP protected under ISO 27001</span></li></ul></div></div><div class="why-cell why-photo-cell why-order-1"><div style="position:relative;overflow:hidden;border-radius:var(--radius-panel);border:1px solid var(--line);background:var(--surface);width:100%;height:100%;min-height:320px;"><img src="~/images/capabilities/cap-pcba-box-build-smt-assembly-why-2.webp" alt="Engineer reviewing a board file at the line" style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;"></div></div></div></div></div></div>

<div style="background:#fff;"><div class="cap-section"><div data-hana-bg="pcb" data-variant="dark" data-accent="" data-fade="none" style="margin:0 0 64px;padding:30px 34px;border-radius:var(--radius-panel);background:var(--hana-blue-deep);color:#fff;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:28px;flex-wrap:wrap;position:relative;overflow:hidden;">
